text = "“I do not hide, yet cannot be touched,
I watch from deep where stars are hushed.
No lock I bear, yet truth I keep,
For those who lie shall never sleep.

The sea, the sky — I make them one,
So speak, and prove what you have done.

Step false, and tides will never part.
Step true, and enter with a steady heart.”"
